{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>it\u2019s so easy to tell the truth.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>doesn\u2019t something in your gut want more of a challenge?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894020/extras/2ea4b68736c5f0ff95efbbac0d11b2f8.avif?t=1761059867\" width=200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>perfect liar is a modern juke-em-up.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">you squeeze the dice roll of a roguelike into the finesse of a bullet hell</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">and you speedrun through it like the world will end if you\u2019re caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894020/extras/de5a9b94c5ba5d1b292b69c65c7687da.webp?t=1761059867\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894020/extras/de5a9b94c5ba5d1b292b69c65c7687da.poster.avif?t=1761059867\" class=\"bb_img\" width=618 height=384 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collect map tiles to chart your path through the liar's maze while simultaneously dodging your way through a web of increasingly menacing angelic foes; think on your feet and make your own luck from the draw to score record times, or plow ahead cautiously taking down each stage as it comes. collect powerups, study patterns of movement, die endlessly\u2014and come back each time ready for more. test your wits with a unique 'dodging only' mechanic through a stark hand-drawn world, overcoming 18 grueling untruths to nerve-wracking electronic blast beats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you know in old cartoons when the train tracks suddenly end and the character has to start nailing boards down ahead of them at lightning speed as they hurtle along?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you know in games when you die but you know next time you won\u2019t, next time you could be a little faster and a little better, and you see yourself stretch past your limits and discover new ones?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you know in real life when each detail complicates things a little more and you\u2019ve got no choice but to keep digging yourself a deeper hole and hope you\u2019ll reach the other side before it caves in?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026it\u2019s kind of like that. push yourself to the limits, discovering sly secrets and clever complications, and emerge on the far side changed forever. is this easy for you? were you born to do this? do you have what it takes to become the perfect liar?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"LIAR I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894020/c017642a28ab38aff1182156223c3e7f89343fc8.jpg"},{"name":"LIAR II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894020/0e442a582fd066b0c6aca6417b7b36cef4450ebf.jpg"},{"name":"LIAR III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894020/c24217e87b0cbac9b7dcc1fa9dc546539181762d.jpg"},{"name":"PERFECT LIAR I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894020/d92c8c1490de57af54bf92b7b53d8e723ee9ef79.jpg"},{"name":"PERFECT LIAR II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3894020/3cbc511883ef57ca81ff9ab79aaaf768f8e22bf5.jpg"},{"name":"PERFECT LIAR III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstati