imits and discover new ones?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you know in real life when each detail complicates things a little more and you\u2019ve got no choice but to keep digging yourself a deeper hole and hope you\u2019ll reach the other side before it caves in?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026it\u2019s kind of like that. push yourself to the limits, discovering sly secrets and clever complications, and emerge on the far side changed forever. is this easy for you? were you born to do this? do you have what it takes to become the perfect liar?</p>","developers":["eightworks allware"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894020/baac842c33497188329c620e748dcc0013a0bf3b/header.jpg?t=1761059867","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3894020/1139290627/ed952016082d18516e3d67af2c77b9b76cfdaa4f/1759832705/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759833006","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3894020/1139290627/ed952016082d18516e3d67af2c77b9b76cfdaa4f/1759832705/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759833006","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3894020/1139290627/ed952016082d18516e3d67af2c77b9b76cfdaa4f/1759832705/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759833006","id":257171282,"name":"Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257171282/2f9174f57bf61d3aab7de6321e676d5e29284888/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759833006"}],"name":"Perfect Liar","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Perfect Liar - $3.99 USD","packageid":136